    "responses": [
      {
        "turn": 5,
        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "Got it, thanks! I have some basic tools for baking bread in the oven at home. What else do I need to get for baking bread in the oven?",
          "user_rubrik": "I have some basic tools for baking bread in the oven at home. What else do I need to get for baking bread in the oven?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "To enhance your bread baking experience at home, consider adding the following tools to your kitchen inventory:\n\n1. **Kitchen Scale**: Essential for accurate measurements, especially when adjusting recipes.\n2. **Dough Scraper**: Helps in handling dough and cleaning the work surface.\n3. **Bread Thermometer**: Ensures your bread is baked to the right internal temperature.\n4. **Banneton Baskets**: Useful for proofing dough, helping it maintain shape and texture.\n5. **Cooling Rack**: Allows your bread to cool evenly after baking.\n6. **Dutch Oven or Baking Stone**: Creates steam during baking, resulting in a better crust.\n7. **Scoring Lame**: For making decorative slashes on bread before baking, which helps control the rise.\n\nThese tools will make your bread baking more efficient and improve the quality of your loaves. Enjoy your baking!",
          "citations": {
            "clueweb22-en0016-38-16516:1": 0.677190363407135,
            "clueweb22-en0002-32-10950:2": 0.6039634346961975,
            "clueweb22-en0039-39-06219:5": 0.5832482576370239,
