            "I have some basic baking experience.",
            "I like to challenge myself."
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "turn": 2,
        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "I'm curious about the advantages of baking bread in my own oven at home. What are the benefits?",
          "user_rubrik": "What are advantages of baking bread in my own oven at home?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "Baking bread in your own oven at home offers several advantages. You have complete control over the ingredients, allowing you to avoid additives and preservatives commonly found in store-bought bread and to add nutritious extras like seeds or nuts for your family's health [clueweb22-en0026-16-06298][clueweb22-en0010-60-07035]. Homemade bread is fresher and tastier, as you can enjoy it straight from the oven, and it stays fresher longer compared to supermarket bread [clueweb22-en0041-74-13364]. Baking at home can also be more cost-effective over time, letting you invest in higher-quality ingredients. Additionally, the process is enjoyable and creative, filling your home with the aroma of fresh bread and allowing you to experiment with different styles and flavors [clueweb22-en0029-44-01013]. Would you like tips for beginner-friendly bread recipes?",
          "citations": {
            "clueweb22-en0026-16-06298:1": 0.03177805800756621,
            "clueweb22-en0010-60-07035:10": 0.031754032258064516,
