          "user_utterance": "I\u2019d like to include pumpkin seeds or sunflower seeds\u2014maybe use spelt or whole wheat flour. I\u2019d prefer to skip white flour and butter. Any tips for making this kind of bread tasty and fluffy in a home oven?",
          "user_rubrik": "I have some basic tools for baking bread in the oven at home. What else do I need to get for baking bread in the oven?",
