          "text": "To make tasty, fluffy whole wheat or spelt bread with seeds, use plenty of hydration, add seeds like pumpkin and sunflower, and consider a bit of vinegar or lemon juice to help the texture. Knead well, let the dough rise fully, and bake in a preheated oven for best results. Are you interested in sourdough or yeast-based recipes?",
