      {
        "turn": 4,
        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "Got it, thanks! Now, what are the main advantages of baking bread in my own oven at home instead of buying it?",
          "user_rubrik": "What are advantages of baking bread in my own oven at home?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "Baking bread at home has several advantages. You can control the ingredients, which is beneficial for people with allergies or those who want to eat healthier. Homemade bread is also fresher and tastes better than store-bought bread. Additionally, baking bread at home can be a fun and rewarding experience, allowing you to be creative and experiment with different recipes and ingredients. Overall, baking bread at home offers a unique combination of health benefits, taste, and enjoyment that makes it a great alternative to buying bread from a store.  You can also save money in the long run by making your own bread.  You will have access to freshly baked bread right from your oven.  You can also become financially independent by baking and selling your own bread.  You can add superfoods to your bread to make it healthier.  You can avoid added preservatives in store-bought bread.  You can have a good time baking your own bread.  You can make your own bread at a lower cost than buying",
