      {
        "turn": 5,
        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "That makes sense, thanks! Do you have a favorite simple bread recipe I could try in a regular oven, something that\u2019s beginner-friendly?",
          "user_rubrik": "What is a good recipe for baking bread in the oven at home?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 3,
          "text": "Yes, a simple recipe to try is a no-knead bread recipe. It requires only 4 ingredients: flour, yeast, salt, and water. The active time is minimal, and it always turns out into a beautiful, flavorful loaf without much effort. You can also try a basic white bread recipe that uses a bread machine to make the dough and then finishes the bread in your oven. These recipes are great for beginners and produce delicious results. Give one of them a try and see how it turns out!",
