          "text": "Using fresh herbs from your garden can add amazing flavor to your bread. You can try mixing chopped herbs like rosemary, thyme, or oregano into your dough for a savory flavor. Alternatively, you can use herbs to create a flavorful oil or butter to brush onto your bread before baking. For example, you can",
