        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "I\u2019m actually curious about bread baking. What are different ways to bake bread at home?",
          "user_rubrik": "What are ways for baking bread at home?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 0,
          "text": "In a basic knife skill workshop, you can expect to learn fundamental techniques such as knife sharpening, chopping, slicing, and dicing. You'll also learn about different types of knives and how to choose the right one for the",
          "citations": {},
