      {
        "turn": 2,
        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "That\u2019s helpful! What are the main advantages of baking bread in my own oven at home?",
          "user_rubrik": "What are advantages of baking bread in my own oven at home?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "Baking bread at home offers several advantages, including complete control over ingredients for a healthier, preservative-free loaf tailored to your dietary needs and preferences (P2, P3, P7, P9, P12, P19). You'll enjoy incredibly fresh, warm bread with a wonderful aroma straight from your oven (P6, P15, P19). Beyond the delicious outcome, it's an enjoyable and satisfying hobby that can reduce stress, boost confidence, and provide a great sense of accomplishment (P1, P4, P10, P18). It can also be more cost-effective in the long run (P5, P7, P19).",
