        "turn": 1,
        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "I\u2019m curious\u2014what are some simple ways to bake bread at home?",
          "user_rubrik": "What are ways for baking bread at home?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "For simple home bread baking, especially with basic experience, the **no-knead method** is highly recommended as it eliminates the most difficult step (P5, P6, P14, P20). Using a **bread machine** also simplifies the process, handling mixing, kneading, and baking (P1, P10, P15, P19). The **straight mixing method** is another straightforward approach for beginners (P4, P9). You can find simple recipes for white or wheat bread (P2) and even use a Dutch oven for a bakery-made finish (P3, P17).",
