        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "Fresh aroma is definitely a bonus! Are there any types of bread that are especially beginner-friendly?",
          "user_rubrik": "What is a good recipe for baking bread in the oven at home?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 2,
          "text": "For beginner-friendly options perfect for sharing, consider loaf cakes like banana bread (especially with chocolate chips), white chocolate and raspberry, or gingerbread loaf cakes, as they are often simple to make. Quick breads, such as banana oatmeal blender muffins or lemon blueberry quick bread, are also great starting points. Additionally, easy yeast dinner rolls, hamburger buns, cornbread, and garlic tear-and-share bread are straightforward choices that your guests or family will enjoy.",
