          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "I\u2019m curious about all the ways you can bake bread at home. What methods are there?",
          "user_rubrik": "What are ways for baking bread at home?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "You can bake bread at home using various methods. The most common involve an oven or a bread machine, or a combination of both. For dough preparation, popular methods include the straight dough method, sponge-and-dough method, and no-knead method. For quick breads, you might use the biscuit, blending, creaming, muffin, or shortening methods. Other techniques like Tangzhong or scalded flour can also be incorporated.",
