      {
        "turn": 3,
        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "I totally agree, that aroma is amazing! Are there any beginner-friendly bread recipes for baking in a regular oven?",
          "user_rubrik": "What is a good recipe for baking bread in the oven at home?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 3,
          "text": "Given your basic baking experience, you can start with several beginner-friendly bread recipes for your oven. Easy options include a basic homemade white bread or simple soft bread rolls. No-knead recipes, like ciabatta or heritage bread, are also great for beginners. If you're interested in sourdough, there are beginner-friendly versions available. Quick breads like banana bread, pumpkin bread, or even focaccia and pretzel bread are also excellent choices to enjoy that amazing aroma!",
          "citations": {
            "clueweb22-en0032-85-09793:11": 0.6775503158569336,
            "clueweb22-en0022-91-10055:1": 0.4888911247253418,
            "clueweb22-en0008-78-13265:0": 0.47626349329948425,
            "clueweb22-en0031-30-02300:4": 0.36692723631858826,
            "clueweb22-en0011-06-01843:5": 0.3578609228134155,
