      {
        "turn": 4,
        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "Nice! I\u2019d love a good simple recipe for white bread in the oven. Can you give me one?",
          "user_rubrik": "What is a good recipe for baking bread in the oven at home?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "Here's a simple recipe for Easy Homemade White Bread, perfect for your oven:\n\n**Ingredients:**\n*   2 2/3 cups all-purpose or bread flour\n*   2 Tbsp sugar\n*   3/4 tsp salt\n*   2 1/2 tsp active dry yeast\n*   1 Tbsp canola or vegetable oil\n*   1 cup warm water (100-115\u00b0F)\n\n**Instructions:**\n1.  In a stand mixer, combine flour, sugar, salt, and yeast.\n2.  Add oil and warm water; mix with dough hook for 1 minute.\n3.  Place dough in a loaf pan and let rise for about 1 hour until 1/2\"-1\" above the pan edge.\n4.  Preheat oven to 350\u00b0F.\n5.  Bake for 25 minutes, or until golden brown.\n\nThis recipe makes one loaf of soft, fluffy bread in about 1 hour 45 minutes total.",
