          "user_utterance": "Thanks! What are some advantages of baking bread in my own oven at home?",
          "user_rubrik": "What are advantages of baking bread in my own oven at home?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "Baking bread at home in your oven offers several advantages. You gain ultimate control over ingredients, ensuring healthier, fresher bread free from unwanted preservatives and trans fats, which is great for your family's diet. It's also a convenient and cost-effective option. Beyond the practical benefits, many find home baking to be a satisfying and calming activity, reducing stress and providing a sense of achievement, enhanced by the wonderful aroma in your home.",
