      {
        "turn": 2,
        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "Interesting! What are some advantages of baking bread in my own oven at home?",
          "user_rubrik": "What are advantages of baking bread in my own oven at home?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "Baking bread at home in your own oven offers several advantages. You gain complete control over ingredients, ensuring healthier loaves free of preservatives and tailored to your preferences. The bread is incredibly fresh and tastier straight from the oven, far surpassing store-bought options. It's also cost-effective and allows for creative expression through kneading and shaping, yielding a light, airy texture with plenty of space for larger loaves, and filling your home with a wonderful aroma.",
