      {
        "turn": 3,
        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "That sounds great\u2014especially the fresh aroma. Is there a beginner-friendly recipe you\u2019d recommend for oven baking?",
          "user_rubrik": "What is a good recipe for baking bread in the oven at home?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "Given your interest in the fresh aroma, a **No-Knead bread** recipe is a fantastic beginner-friendly option for oven baking. These recipes are highly recommended for their simplicity and minimal effort. Many, like the **No-Knead Dutch Oven Bread**, use just 4-5 ingredients and produce a beautiful, crusty loaf. You could also try **King Arthur Flour's Peasant Bread** or a general **Homemade Artisan Bread**, both known for being easy and hands-off. For a classic taste, an **Easy & Perfect Homemade White Bread for Beginners** is also a great choice.",
