          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "For fatty liver, baking your own bread is ideal to control ingredients. Excellent choices include **rye bread**, often blended with **whole wheat flour** to enhance flavor and texture. **Homemade keto breads** are also highly recommended, as they are low-carb and avoid additives found in store-bought versions. **Sprouted whole-grain breads** are another beneficial option, rich in fiber and nutrients. Always prioritize whole-grain, fiber-rich flours and avoid refined white flour. Remember to enjoy even these healthier breads in moderation, typically 2-3 slices per day.",
