          "user_rubrik": "I have some basic tools for baking bread in the oven at home. What else do I need to get for baking bread in the oven?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "To enhance your home bread baking, consider adding a **Dutch oven** (or a **baking stone** for crispier crusts), a **bread thermometer** for perfect doneness, and a **scoring lame** for beautiful slashes. A **kitchen scale** ensures precise ingredient measurements, while **dough and bowl scrapers** make handling dough easier. A **cooling rack** is also beneficial for proper cooling, and a **cast iron skillet** can be used for steam.",
