          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "I\u2019m actually looking into baking bread at home. What methods are out there?",
          "user_rubrik": "What are ways for baking bread at home?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "For baking bread at home, common methods include the straight dough method (mixing all ingredients at once) and the sponge-and-dough method (a two-stage process). The Tangzhong method is also popular for a softer crumb. For the actual baking, you can use a conventional oven (often with a Dutch oven for crusty bread), a bread machine (which handles mixing, proofing, and baking), or a combination of both, where the machine prepares the dough and you finish it in the oven.",
