        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "Great points. Do you have any recipe recommendations for someone with basic baking experience?",
          "user_rubrik": "What is a good recipe for baking bread in the oven at home?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 4,
          "text": "For someone with basic baking experience, several easy bread recipes are available. You could start with **Basic White Bread** (Passage 14) or an **Everyday Basic Bread** (Passage 4). **No-knead artisan bread** (Passage 6, 14) is also a great option, simplifying the process. **Quick breads** (Passage 18, 11, 17), like **banana bread** (Passage 4, 18) or **zucchini bread** (Passage 18, 20), are excellent as they typically don't require yeast. Other simple choices include **easy flatbread** (Passage 7) or **60-minute dinner rolls** (Passage 4).",
