          "user_utterance": "Interesting! What are the main advantages of baking bread in my own oven at home?",
          "user_rubrik": "What are advantages of baking bread in my own oven at home?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "Baking bread in your own conventional oven at home offers several advantages. You gain ultimate control over ingredients, allowing for healthier, customized loaves with fewer preservatives. It can also be more economical in the long run. Beyond practicalities, home baking provides a sense of achievement and relaxation, filling your home with a comforting aroma. Conventional ovens are familiar, easy to use, and many recipes are designed for them, often yielding a better rise for your bread.",
