          "user_utterance": "That\u2019s very helpful, thanks! I have some basic tools for baking bread in the oven at home. What else do I need to get for baking bread in the oven?",
          "user_rubrik": "I have some basic tools for baking bread in the oven at home. What else do I need to get for baking bread in the oven?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "Beyond basic tools, consider acquiring a kitchen scale for accurate ingredient measurement, a Dutch oven for a crusty loaf, and a bench or bowl scraper for easier dough handling. A bread thermometer is useful for precise temperature control, and a scoring lame or razor blade helps with dough expansion and design. Parchment paper for easy transfer and a cooling rack for proper cooling are also highly recommended.",
