          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "Nice, thanks! What would you say are the advantages of baking bread in my own oven at home?",
          "user_rubrik": "What are advantages of baking bread in my own oven at home?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "big advantages to baking at home : - control and health : choose simple ingredients ( flour, water, salt, yeast ) and adjust salt, sugar, whole grains, and seeds to your needs and your child \u2019 s. - freshness and flavor : nothing beats just - baked aroma and a crisp crust with a tender crumb. - customization : fold in your garden herbs, cheeses, nuts, or even a touch of your favorite hot sauces. - cost and convenience : inexpensive staples ; bake on your schedule. dough can be cold - proofed overnight for easy timing. - quality with simple gear : a preheated dutch oven traps steam and provides steady heat, boosting oven spring, color, and shine while simplifying the process. - consistency : the pot \u2019 s thermal mass evens out temperature swings for reliable results in a home oven. - variety : from lean sourdough to enriched sandwich loaves, baguettes, ciabatta, and no \u2011 knead \u2014 one oven, many styles. - family activity : kid - friendly shaping and scoring ; great for sharing with guests. - skill - building : satisfying craft that rewards practice and experimentation. - better than store - bought shelf life : no additive",
