      {
        "turn": 4,
        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "Nice, looks pretty straightforward! I\u2019ve recently been told I have fatty liver\u2014does that change which homemade breads are actually healthy for me? What should I watch out for in ingredients or methods?",
